      "writtenOn": "2024-11-13T21:42:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I noticed we\u0027re using a concurrent hash map here, which IIRC should make concurrent gets and puts safe.\n\nIf anything, we only need to lock around the initial object retrieval. Anything else I think is overkill.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 589,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 589,
